[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0452","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0452.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-11209","title":"Google Chrome Android 版 Omnibox 不当实现漏洞","description":"Google Chrome for Android 的 Omnibox（地址栏）存在实现不当漏洞（CWE-290），远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面，在无需用户交互的情况下欺骗 Omnibox 显示虚假的 URL 内容，导致用户误判当前访问的网站身份。该漏洞影响 Chrome for Android 141.0.7390.54 之前版本，攻击者可利用此漏洞实施钓鱼攻击或诱导用户泄露敏感信息，对机密性造成高影响，对完整性造成低影响，CVSS 评分 8.2，危害等级高危。Google 已在 Chrome 141.0.7390.54 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2025-11209"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-06T22:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:29:51Z","remediation":"立即将 Android 端 Google Chrome 升级至 141.0.7390.54 或更高版本（通过 Google Play 商店更新）；Linux 发行版用户更新至 chromium-141.0.7390.122 或更高版本。临时缓解措施可禁用不可信来源的 HTML 页面渲染或使用安全浏览器内核替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/09/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_30.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/438226517","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11209.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11209.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1d7afb428742628d991f2465e712a059beb8d79/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11209.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-11209","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-11209.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2025/11/GHSA-xvxm-x86g-723r/GHSA-xvxm-x86g-723r.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2025-11209","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-11209.json","https://github.com/illuusio/freebsd-osv/blob/3234f9e67d0170ff9c6cada9a1f48f061b109728/md/2025/FreeBSD-2025-0308.md","https://github.com/gentoo-mirror/gentoo/blob/8823b4a8826df8718040c2ef9c9a217a28df3f85/metadata/glsa/glsa-202511-04.xml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0452.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0451","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0451.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-11208","title":"Google Chrome Media 组件不当实现导致用户界面欺骗漏洞","description":"Google Chrome（Chromium）141.0.7390.54之前版本的Media组件存在UI实现不当漏洞（CWE-451）。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的HTML页面，诱骗用户执行特定的UI手势交互，从而触发UI欺骗攻击，导致用户界面显示内容被篡改。成功利用该漏洞可导致机密性、完整性和可用性均受到低度影响。攻击者需要用户主动参与交互，降低了攻击门槛。Google已在Chrome 141.0.7390.54版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-11208"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-06T22:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:29:51Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 141.0.7390.54 及以上版本，基于 Chromium 的浏览器（如 Edge、Brave）需同步更新至对应版本。Fedora 43 用户执行 `sudo dnf update chromium` 升级至 141.0.7390.122。无法立即升级时，可配置组策略禁用自动播放媒体内容作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/09/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_30.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/397878997","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11208.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11208.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1d7afb428742628d991f2465e712a059beb8d79/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11208.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-11208","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-11208.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/adviso