2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11207.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-11207","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/bf66e61ceed5e250997657c9323c46b0c5917025/community/qt6-qtwebengine/APKBUILD","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-11207.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2025/11/GHSA-vrf4-5hv4-fc3q/GHSA-vrf4-5hv4-fc3q.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2025-11207","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-11207.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/d8a287381c78b37aa3d10fca316ba2301f060da3/packages/c/chromium/.rev"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0450.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0449","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0449.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-11206","title":"Google Chromium Video 堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 141.0.7390.54 之前版本中的 Video 组件存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞，该漏洞源于对视频数据处理时边界检查不严格，导致越界写入。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面诱导用户访问，成功利用此漏洞可实现沙箱逃逸，造成机密性、完整性和可用性受损。CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高，用户交互为触发条件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-11206"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-06T22:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:29:51Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 141.0.7390.54 或更高版本（通过设置→关于 Chrome 自动检查更新），该版本已修复 Video 模块中的堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。基于 Chromium 的浏览器（Microsoft Edge、Brave、Opera 等）需同步更新至对应修复版本。Fedora 43 用户应更新至 chromium-141.0.7390.122。无法立即升级时，可启用 Chrome 的站点隔离功能（chrome://flags/#site-isolation-trial-opt-out）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/09/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_30.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/444755026","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11206.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11206.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1d7afb428742628d991f2465e712a059beb8d79/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11206.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-11206","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-11206.md","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/bf66e61ceed5e250997657c9323c46b0c5917025/community/qt6-qtwebengine/APKBUILD","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2025/11/GHSA-62xm-7pjx-wfv7/GHSA-62xm-7pjx-wfv7.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2025-11206","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-11206.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/d8a287381c78b37aa3d10fca316ba2301f060da3/packages/c/chromium/.rev"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0449.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0448","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0448.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-11205","title":"Google Chrome WebGPU 堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 的 WebGPU 组件中存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-122/CWE-787），攻击者若已攻陷渲染器进程，可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面触发堆内存损坏，进而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Chrome 141.0.7390.54 之前的所有版本，攻击需用户交互（访问恶意页面），CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Google 已在 Chrome 141.0.7390.54 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-11205"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-06T22:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:29:51Z","remediation":"立即升级 Google Chrome 至 141.0.7390.54 及以上版本，通过 Chrome 菜单「帮助」→「关于 Google Chrome」检查并安装更新。基于 Chromium 的浏览器（如 Edge、Brave）需同步更新至对应版本。Fedora 43 用户执行 `sudo dnf update chromium` 升级至 141.0.7390.122。如无法立即更新，可在浏览器设置中禁用 WebGPU（chrome://flags/#enable-unsafe-webgpu）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/09/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_30.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/442444724","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11205.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11205.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1d7afb428742628d991f2465e712a059beb8d79/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11205.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-11205","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-11205.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2025/11/GHSA-j64g-h2wj-jx5r/GHSA-j64g-h2wj-jx5r.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2025-11205","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-11205.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/d8a287381c78b37aa3d10fca316ba2301f060da3/packages/c/chromium/.rev","https://github.com/kidrek/VigilIntel/blob/5c40d7f3362ab33435de1b09462e6122b81573b4/2025/10/2025-10-02-report.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0448.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0362","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0362.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21079","title":"Samsung Samsung Members 开放重定向漏洞","description":"三星 Galaxy S25 设备上的 Samsung Members 应用（版本 5.5.01.3 之前）存在输入验证不当漏洞，远程攻击者可利用该漏洞诱导用户点击恶意链接，从而以 Samsung Members 权限连接任意 URL 并启动任意 Activity。该漏洞在 Pwn2Own 大赛中被公开演示，攻击需用户交互，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。用户应升级 Samsung Members 至 5.5.01.3 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21079"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2025-11-05T06:15:34Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:34Z","remediation":"立即将 Samsung Members 应用升级至 5.5.01.3 及以上版本，可通过 Galaxy Store 或设置中的「软件更新」路径获取。如无法立即更新，可在 Samsung Members 设置中关闭「通过链接打开」等自动跳转功能，并教育用户不要点击来源不明的链接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://security.samsungmobile.com/serviceWeb.smsb?year=2025&month=11","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21079.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2b9f82473296f370428cbc110ec5b988e3fd692/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21079.json","https://github.com/MaliciousErection/maliciouserection.github.io/blob/b520cc90e18d6b4d0ee96300aafc87c0bf5b2524/_cves/2025-03-01_cve-2025-21079.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2025-21079.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/11/GHSA-vrx8-mx5x-r6qv/GHSA-vrx8-mx5x-r6qv.json","https://github.com/Ch0pin/related_work/blob/e61545555f305c905c522609d078a64379ac4fbd/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21079.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/08ea89e8807d0d5cf7150243c834721985237c9e/CVEs_log/2025-11-06_zh.md","https://github.com/delikely/ZDI_Advisories/blob/6b55e3ba1a5f6029db981377240e35731b742a92/advisories/2026/ZDI-26-209.json","https://github.com/psocik/ict/blob/7d78dc128b21c4cfd10257bd7b2b39346702bdfa/_posts/2025/2025-11-06-2025-11-06-Daily-Vulns.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0362.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0527","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0527.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12464","title":"QEMU e1000 网络设备 堆栈缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"这是针对QEMU虚拟机中e1000网络设备的一个栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。问题源于虚拟机在环回模式下处理短数据帧时，设备接收代码仍然可以调用e1000_receive_iov()函数，导致缓冲区发生溢出并可能导致主机端QEMU进程崩溃进而引发拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞影响在环回模式下运行QEMU KVM的Linux主机系统，CVSS评分6.2，危害等级为中危。攻击者可以通过向目标系统发送特制的IPv4/IPv6短数据帧触发此漏洞，实现对目标虚拟机进程的控制和破坏。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12464"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-10-31T22:15:32Z","updated":"2026-06-30T00:16:51Z","remediation":"将 QEMU 升级至上游修复版本：v8.2.2、v10.0.7、v10.1.3 或 v10.2.0 及以上（该漏洞自 v8.1.0-rc0 引入）。各发行版请安装对应安全更新：Ubuntu 升级至 1:8.2.2+ds-0ubuntu1.13 或 1:10.1.0+ds-5ubuntu2.4；Debian bookworm/trixie 升级至 1:7.2+dfsg-7+deb12u18 或 1:10.0.7+ds-0+deb13u1 及以上版本。如暂无补丁可临时缓解：在 libvirt XML 或 QEMU 启动参数中将虚拟网卡类型从 e1000 替换为 virtio-net，或禁用不依赖于 e1000 的 guest 环回网络功能，以消除触发栈溢出的代码路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2025-12464","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2408845","https://gitlab.com/qemu-project/qemu/-/issues/3043","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12464.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f167926487b7da90867c80cac87302a7f8196ec5/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12464.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-12464.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12464.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-12464.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-12464.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-12464.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-124xx/CVE-2025-12464.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-12464","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2025/CVE-2025-12464.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0527.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0498","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0498.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12060","title":"Keras keras.utils.get_file 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Keras 的 `keras.utils.get_file` API 在使用 `extract=True` 选项处理 tar 压缩包时存在路径遍历漏洞。该函数调用 Python 的 `tarfile.extractall` 方法时未启用 `filter=\"data\"` 安全过滤机制，远程攻击者可构造包含恶意符号链接的特制 tar 归档文件，在解压过程中将任意文件写入目标文件系统的任意位置，突破预期目标文件夹的限制。此漏洞与 Python tarfile 模块的底层缺陷（CVE-2025-4517）相关，但仅升级 Python 至修复版本（如 3.13.4）仍不足，还需将 Keras 升级至 3.12 及以上版本方可完全修复。CVSS 评分 8.9，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12060"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-10-30T17:15:37Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:31:38Z","remediation":"立即将 Keras 升级至 3.12.0 或更高版本（该版本在 `tarfile.extractall()` 中启用了 `filter=\"data\"` 安全参数），同时将 Python 升级至 3.13.4 或更高版本以修复底层 tarfile 的 PATH_MAX 符号链接解析缺陷。如无法立即升级，临时缓解措施为：避免对不可信的 tar 压缩包使用 `keras.utils.get_file()` 的 `extract=True` 选项，或自行在提取前对 tar 文件进行安全过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/keras-team/keras/pull/21760","https://github.com/keras-team/keras/security/advisories/GHSA-hjqc-jx6g-rwp9","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-12060.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12060.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5f10816d455ad0d7b2a1abab6159b8d8e7afc3c8/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12060.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12060.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-12060.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2025/CVE-2025-12060.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-12060.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-12060.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-12060.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-12060.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0498.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0498.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0497","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0497.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12058","title":"Keras Model.load_model 任意本地文件加载与服务器端请求伪造漏洞","description":"Keras 模型加载组件中的 StringLookup 层在处理 vocabulary 参数时存在路径加载限制绕过漏洞。即使启用了 safe_mode=True 安全模式，攻击者仍可通过构造恶意的 .keras 存档文件，在 StringLookup 层配置中嵌入本地文件路径或远程 URL。当受害者加载该恶意模型时，Keras 会利用 tf.io.gfile 读取指定路径内容并纳入模型状态（可通过 get_vocabulary() 获取），导致任意本地文件读取；同时由于 tf.io.gfile 支持 GCS、HDFS 及 HTTP/HTTPS 等远程协议，攻击者可进一步实现服务端请求伪造（SSRF）。该漏洞影响所有使用 Keras Model.load_model 加载不可信模型文件的场景，CVSS 评分 5.9，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12058"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-10-29T09:15:35Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:31:38Z","remediation":"立即升级 Keras 至 3.12.3 或更高版本（含 PR #21751 修复），该版本已将 StringLookup/IntegerLookup 的 vocabulary 嵌入 .keras 归档并在 safe_mode=True 时禁止加载外部词汇文件。如无法升级，切勿加载来源不可信的 .keras 模型，并在加载前手动检查 config.json 中 StringLookup/IntegerLookup 层的 vocabulary 字段是否为文件路径或 URL。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/keras-team/keras/pull/21751","https://github.com/keras-team/keras/security/advisories/GHSA-qg93-c7p6-gg7f","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-12058.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12058.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5f10816d455ad0d7b2a1abab6159b8d8e7afc3c8/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12058.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/GHSA/data/2025/CVE-2025-12058.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12058.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-12058.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2025/CVE-2025-12058.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-12058.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-12058.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-12058.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0497.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0501","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0501.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12105","title":"GNOME libsoup HTTP/2 消息队列处理释放后使用漏洞","description":"libsoup 库是 GNOME 和 WebKit 应用广泛使用的 HTTP 通信库，其 HTTP/2 异步消息队列处理中存在状态同步缺失缺陷。当网络操作在特定时间窗口被取消时，内部消息队列项因缺少状态检查而被重复释放（double-free），导致堆释放后使用（use-after-free）内存访问。攻击者可远程发送特制的 HTTP/2 读取和取消序列触发此漏洞，造成目标应用崩溃，属于拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞影响 libsoup 3.6.5 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12105"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-10-23T10:15:32Z","updated":"2026-06-30T00:16:51Z","remediation":"[id]\nave_id = \"AVE-2025-12105\"\naliases = [\"CVE-2025-12105\"]\n\n[basic]\ntitle = \"GNOME libsoup HTTP/2 消息队列处理中的堆释放后使用漏洞\"\ndescription = \"libsoup 库是 GNOME 和 WebKit 应用广泛使用的 HTTP 通信库。其 HTTP/2 异步消息队列处理中存在状态同步缺失缺陷：当网络操作在特定时间窗口被取消时，内部消息队列项可能因缺少状态检查而被重复释放（double-free），导致堆释放后使用（use-after-free）内存访问。攻击者可远程发送特制的 HTTP/2 读取和取消序列触发此漏洞，造成目标应用崩溃，属于拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞影响 libsoup 3.6.5 及之前版本。\"\nseverity = \"HIGH\"\nscore = 7.5\nsources = [\"cve\", \"redhat\"]\npublished = \"2025-10-23\"\nupdated = \"2026-06-29\"\nremediation = \"升级 libsoup 至 3.6.5 以上版本，或应用 GNOME GitLab MR !481 的补丁。Red Hat 已发布 RHSA-2025:23139 和 RHSA-2025:23437 修复 RHEL 10 受影响版本。\"\n\n[references]\nurls = [\"https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2025-12105\", \"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2405992\", \"https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libsoup/-/merge_requests/481\", \"https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:23139\", \"https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:23437\"]\n\n[exploit]\npoc_urls = []\nexp_urls = []\n\n[meta]\nstatus = \"completed\"\ncollected_at = \"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z\"","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:23139","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:23437","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2025-12105","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2405992","https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libsoup/-/merge_requests/481","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12105.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/95f29039d9df9f64ea752bc1ef04de2ad5981e05/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12105.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-12105.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12105.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-12105.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-12105.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-12105.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-121xx/CVE-2025-12105.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-12105.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-12105"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0501.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0463","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0463.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-11411","title":"NLnet Labs Unbound 域名劫持漏洞","description":"NLnet Labs Unbound 解析器 1.24.1 及之前版本存在域名劫持漏洞，攻击者可在 DNS 响应中注入未经请求的 NS 资源记录集（RRSet）及其对应地址记录，利用碎片攻击或数据包伪造等方式，诱使解析器更新域名的授权委派信息，从而实现域名劫持。该漏洞影响使用 Unbound 作为 DNS 解析器的各类系统，攻击者需处于同一网络段（邻近网络）才能利用，CVSS 评分 5.7，危害等级中危。Unbound 1.24.1 已通过清理非请求 NS RRSet 部分缓解该问题，1.24.2 进一步增强了清理机制。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.7,"aliases":["CVE-2025-11411"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-10-22T13:15:29Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:30:23Z","remediation":"升级 Unbound 至 1.24.2 或更高版本，该版本在 1.24.1 的基础上额外修复了 YXDOMAIN 和非引用 nodata 响应中的混杂 NS 记录问题。如无法立即升级，可在 Unbound 配置中启用 `scrub: yes` 并配置 `qname-minimisation: yes` 以降低缓存投毒风险，同时在网络边界部署 DNSSEC 验证并过滤非预期的 DNS 响应包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.nlnetlabs.nl/downloads/unbound/CVE-2025-11411.txt","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/11/26/4","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/11/msg00008.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/11/msg00032.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1842f861696b8e0d2a79b27d77e1bfea36333d86/cves/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11411.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/2a2183b97032e27dffc48e0c05258a59a58abd74/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-11411.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-11411","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a2c62c60ff1862a166bb0b583b0e40e8effbf660/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11411.json","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/682e5cbb15bd75c943ec6fe2572c1c8d418262ca/specs/u/unbound/unbound.spec","https://github.com/grafana/grafana-image-renderer/blob/0a918126b9e7fd11d49cb100c32a439da9d3d30d/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2025-11411.md","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/2481eb5f86fa92f307b44585a9954e8949e287c9/main/unbound/APKBUILD","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/45fc709d7c9e52b6b02fa499e9caf25f8f9cf0ac/references/CVE-2025-11411-2025-12-21-0805","https://github.com/freebsd/freebsd-doc/blob/000fcf9724e18664a04fee3720eaaad4a7b141d9/website/content/en/releases/14.4R/relnotes.adoc"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0463.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0487","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0487.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-11840","title":"GNU Binutils ldmisc.c vfinfo 越界读取漏洞","description":"GNU Binutils 2.45 版本的 ldmisc.c 文件中 vfinfo 函数存在越界读取漏洞。本地攻击者可通过构造特制的输入文件触发该漏洞，导致进程读取超出缓冲区边界的内存数据，可能造成敏感信息泄露或程序崩溃。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，需本地访问权限，无需用户交互。","severity":"LOW","score":1.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-11840"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-10-16T16:15:37Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:31:15Z","remediation":"立即将 GNU Binutils 升级至 2.45 以上版本，应用补丁 16357（https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/attachment.cgi?id=16357）。如使用 Siemens SIMATIC S7-1500 CPU 1518-4 PN/DP MFP，请升级固件至 V3.1.6 或更高版本。无法升级时，限制本地用户对链接器的交互式调用权限作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/attachment.cgi?id=16351","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/attachment.cgi?id=16357","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=33455","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.328775","https://vuldb.com/?id.328775","https://vuldb.com/?submit.661281","https://www.gnu.org/","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-082556.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11840.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11840.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11840.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-11840.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-11840.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-11840.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-11840","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-11840.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0ccbe74701d72e8d7117a09b2db369605fa0bae6/2025/CVE-2025-11840.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-11840.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0487.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0486","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0486.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-11839","title":"GNU Binutils prdbg.c 未检查返回值漏洞","description":"GNU Binutils 2.45 版本的 prdbg.c 文件中的 tg_tag_type 函数存在未检查返回值漏洞。该函数在处理调试信息时未对返回值进行有效性验证，可能导致程序在特定输入下出现异常行为。攻击者需要本地访问系统并具备低权限，通过构造特制的二进制文件触发该漏洞，造成受影响程序拒绝服务。由于该漏洞利用代码已公开，攻击门槛较低，可能被用于本地拒绝服务攻击。","severity":"LOW","score":1.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-11839"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-10-16T14:15:34Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:31:15Z","remediation":"升级 GNU Binutils 至 2.45 之后已修复该问题的版本（关注 sourceware.org bug #33448 的补丁提交）。对于 SIMATIC S7-1500 CPU 1518-4 PN/DP MFP V3.1.5 用户，目前尚无官方修复，建议关注西门子安全公告 SSA-082556 的更新，并限制对受影响设备的本地访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/attachment.cgi?id=16344","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=33448","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.328774","https://vuldb.com/?id.328774","https://vuldb.com/?submit.661279","https://www.gnu.org/","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-082556.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11839.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11839.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11839.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-11839.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-11839.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-11839.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-11839.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-11839","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0ccbe74701d72e8d7117a09b2db369605fa0bae6/2025/CVE-2025-11839.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-11839.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0486.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0376","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0376.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0033","title":"AMD SEV-SNP 初始化期间 RMP 访问控制不当漏洞","description":"AMD SEV-SNP 的 RMP（反向映射表）初始化过程中存在不当访问控制漏洞（CWE-284）。拥有管理员权限的本地攻击者可在 SNP 初始化期间向 RMP 写入数据，破坏 SEV-SNP 安全加密虚拟化机制的内存完整性保护，导致虚拟机客户内存的机密性丧失。该漏洞需攻击者具备本地管理员权限，攻击复杂度低，影响 AMD EPYC 处理器等支持 SEV-SNP 的平台。AMD 已发布固件更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0033"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-10-14T15:16:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:25:41Z","remediation":"建议立即更新 AMD EPYC 7003 系列（Milan）处理器固件至 MilanPI 1.0.0.H 及以上版本，EPYC 9005 系列（Turin）处理器固件至 TurinPI 1.0.0.6 及以上版本。请从 AMD 官网或服务器 OEM 厂商获取对应 BIOS/固件更新包，按照平台文档完成固件升级并重启系统。如无法立即更新，可在 SNP 初始化期间限制管理员对主机的物理或带外管理访问权限，并监控 RMP 相关日志异常作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.amd.com/en/resources/product-security/bulletin/AMD-SB-3020.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2025/CVE-2025-0033.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0033.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b7d9f3f65d1036a114c9bae4a66ed35d83999166/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-0033.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-0033","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0033.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-0033.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-9mfq-5f97-7wjc/GHSA-9mfq-5f97-7wjc.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2025-0033","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-0033.json","https://github.com/edgelesssys/contrast/blob/f1f61c0b4d2517cda41f1ef05e8b163ac03a67d8/docs/versioned_docs/version-1.21/architecture/components/manifest.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0376.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0478","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0478.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-11731","title":"libxslt EXSLT 类型混淆拒绝服务漏洞","description":"libxslt 的 exsltFuncResultComp() 函数在处理样式表解析中的 EXSLT &lt;func:result&gt; 元素时，由于类型处理不当，可能将 XML 文档节点误当作普通 XML 元素节点处理，导致类型混淆（CWE-843）。该漏洞影响 libxslt 1.1.44 之前版本，以及 Red Hat Enterprise Linux 7/8/9、Red Hat OpenShift Container Platform 4 等集成产品。攻击者需在网络可达的前提下诱使用户加载特制 XSLT 样式表才能触发，利用条件苛刻（高攻击复杂度、需用户交互），成功利用可导致应用程序不稳定或拒绝服务。该漏洞由 Google Big Sleep 报告给 Red Hat，目前尚无公开利用代码。","severity":"LOW","score":3.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-11731"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-10-14T06:15:34Z","updated":"2026-06-30T07:16:30Z","remediation":"升级 libxslt 至 1.1.44 或更高版本。openSUSE 用户可通过 zypper update libxslt 安装安全更新。如无法立即升级，可在解析不可信样式表时禁用 EXSLT 功能（--without-plugins 编译），或限制仅处理受信任的 XSLT 文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:11015","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2025-11731","https://bugzi